---

---

<div class="AboutUs-title">
  <h1>¿Quieres saber más sobre nosotros?</h1>
  <p>Somos el grupo con más <span>estilo :)</span></p>
  <div class="AboutUs-container">
    <div class="About-Pablo">
      <img src="./public/img/cloud-solid.svg" alt="cloud" />
    </div>
    <div class="About-Cris">
      <img class="cris" src="./public/img/CrisAbout.png" alt="" />
      <img src="./public/img/sun-solid.svg" alt="sun" />
    </div>
    <div class="About-Michael">
      <img src="./public/img/umbrella-solid.svg" alt="umbrella" />
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .AboutUs-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 50px;
    color: #2128bd;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;

    & h1 {
    }

    & p {
      font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 25px;
      color: #2c2c2c;
    }

    & span {
      font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;
      color: #2128bd;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 700;

      &:hover {
        color: #868cf9;
      }
    }
  }
  .AboutUs-container {
    height: 700px;
    background: yellow;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    background-image: url("./public/img/wallpaper.jpg");
  }

  .About-Pablo {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: red;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .About-Cris {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: red;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    hoverflow: hidden;
    position: relative;

    & .cris {
      position: absolute;
      width: 380px;
      height: auto;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  }
  .About-Michael {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: red;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>
